==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Tynamo|39}} from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*'''Tiny Bolt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Toxel|106}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

